nt credentials to verify your identity.\\n3. Once verified, our system will initiate the deletion process, which may take a few minutes to complete.\\n4. After the deletion process is complete, we will send you a confirmation email to let you know that your account has been successfully deleted.\\n\\nPlease note that once your account is deleted, we will not be able to retrieve any data associated with it, including any previous orders, payments, or communications.\\n\\nCategory: Account", "status": "ok", "case_id": "delete-account", "charges": [], "evaluator": "normalized:v1", "reasoning": null, "latency_ms": "2543.2967", "quality_score": "0"}, {"calls": [{"tags": {}, "model": "llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M", "status": "ok", "attempt": 1, "call_id": "b0df79ce-0c6a-4873-acfb-04d3b3ea0eb5", "step_id": "model-1", "provider": "ollama", "operation": "chat", "latency_ms": "2081.1306", "input_tokens": 116, "usage_source": "gateway", "output_tokens": 225}], "error": null, "steps": [{"kind": "model", "name": "llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M", "tags": {}, "status": "ok", "step_id": "model-1", "latency_ms": "2081.1306", "parent_step_id": null}], "output": "I'd like to summarize your concern: You've placed an order, but it hasn't shipped yet, and you're wondering if you can upgrade to express delivery instead.\\n\\nTo help you with this, I'd recommend checking our shipping options and estimated delivery times. Since your order hasn't shipped yet, we can't guarantee the exact delivery time. However, I can guide you on how to proceed.\\n\\nTo upgrade to express delivery, you'll need to contact our customer service team. We can assist you with this, and I can provide you with more information on our express delivery options and any applicable fees.\\n\\nHere's a helpful first reply the support agent could send:\\n\\n\\"Hello! Thank you for reaching out to us about your order. I apologize for the delay in shipping. I'd be happy to help you with upgrading to express delivery. Please note that our express delivery option is available for an additional fee. I'll need to check on the status of your order and provide you with more information on the upgrade process. Can you please confirm your order number so I can look into this further for you?\\"\\n\\nCategory: Shipping", "status": "ok", "case_id": "express-upgrade", "charges": [], "evaluator": "normalized:v1", "reasoning": null, "latency_ms": "2083.7585", "quality_score": "0"}], "pricing": {"source": "Notional per-token rates entered for the demo. Replace them with your provider's prices; local inference has no per-token bill.", "entries": [{"model": "llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M", "provider": "ollama", "input_per_million_usd": "0.1", "output_per_million_usd": "0.4"}], "version": "reference-rates-2026-10"}, "suite_id": "support-triage", "artifact_id": "2bf4e701-f2f5-4685-9806-cce3e35ff7bb", "configuration": {"kind": "prompt", "model": "llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M", "limits": "{\\"timeout_seconds\\":180,\\"max_output_tokens\\":400,\\"max_attempts\\":1,\\"max_tool_calls\\":0,\\"max_steps\\":4,\\"stop_after_usd\\":null}", "provider": "ollama", "temperature": "0.0", "system_prompt": "You are a friendly and thorough customer support assistant. For every customer message: first restate the customer's problem in your own words, then explain step by step which support category fits best and why, then suggest a helpful first reply the support agent could send, and finally state the category. The categories are billing, technical, account, and shipping. Be empathetic and complete."}, "schema_version": 1}	2026-10-21 20:21:13.82407+00
